ineq 0.2-13 numerical translation

Original R package: ineq, version 0.2-13, released 2014-07-21.
Author and maintainer: Achim Zeileis <Achim.Zeileis@R-project.org>.
Contributor: Christian Kleiber <Christian.Kleiber@unibas.ch>.
Title: Measuring Inequality, Concentration, and Poverty.

The Fortran implementation translates and modifies numerical algorithms in the
original R package, with explicit static types, IEEE missing values, stable
numerical evaluation, and new deterministic tests. Translation prepared in 2026.
